"surface":"கொளினே","parts":[{"text":"கொளின்","lemma":"கொள்","gloss":"if take/hold"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"emphasis"}],"gloss":"if [one] takes/holds"},{"surface":"கடைப்புணை","parts":[{"text":"கடை","lemma":"கடை","gloss":"end/last"},{"text":"புணை","lemma":"புணை","gloss":"raft"}],"gloss":"last raft / end raft"},{"surface":"கொள்ளும்","parts":[{"text":"கொள்ளும்","lemma":"கொள்","gloss":"will take/hold"}],"gloss":"will take/hold"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"புணைகை","parts":[{"text":"புணை","lemma":"புணை","gloss":"raft"},{"text":"கை","lemma":"கை","gloss":"hand"}],"gloss":"holding hand of the raft"},{"surface":"விட்டு","parts":[{"text":"விட்டு","lemma":"விடு","gloss":"letting go"}],"gloss":"letting go"},{"surface":"புனலோடு","parts":[{"text":"புனல்","lemma":"புனல்","gloss":"water/flood"},{"text":"ஓடு","lemma":"ஓடு","gloss":"with"}],"gloss":"with the water/current"},{"surface":"ஒழுகின்","parts":[{"text":"ஒழுகின்","lemma":"ஒழுகு","gloss":"if flows/goes along"}],"gloss":"if flowing/going along"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"ஆண்டும்","parts":[{"text":"ஆண்டு","lemma":"ஆண்டு","gloss":"there"},{"text":"உம்","lemma":"உம்","gloss":"also"}],"gloss":"there also"},{"surface":"வருகுவள்","parts":[{"text":"வருகுவள்","lemma":"வரு","gloss":"she will come"}],"gloss":"she will come"},{"surface":"போலும்","parts":[{"text":"போலும்","lemma":"போலும்","gloss":"it seems"}],"gloss":"it seems"},{"surface":"மாண்ட","parts":[{"text":"மாண்ட","lemma":"மாண்","gloss":"glorious/excellent"}],"gloss":"excellent / glorious"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"மாரி","parts":[{"text":"மாரி","lemma":"மாரி","gloss":"rain"}],"gloss":"rainy season"},{"surface":"பித்திகத்து","parts":[{"text":"பித்திகத்து","lemma":"பித்திகம்","gloss":"of the wild jasmine"}],"gloss":"of the wild jasmine"},{"surface":"நீர்வார்","parts":[{"text":"நீர்","lemma":"நீர்","gloss":"water"},{"text":"வார்","lemma":"வார்","gloss":"dripping/flowing"}],"gloss":"water-dripping"},{"surface":"கொழுமுகை","parts":[{"text":"கொழு","lemma":"கொழு","gloss":"fat/rich/plump"},{"text":"முகை","lemma":"முகை","gloss":"bud"}],"gloss":"plump bud"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"செவ்வெரி","parts":[{"text":"செவ்வெரி","lemma":"செவ்வெரி","gloss":"red spark/glow"}],"gloss":"red spark/glow"},{"surface":"நுறழும்","parts":[{"text":"நுறழும்","lemma":"நுறழ்","gloss":"resembling"}],"gloss":"resembling"},{"surface":"கொழுங்கடை","parts":[{"text":"கொழும்","lemma":"கொழுமை","gloss":"rich/abundant"},{"text":"கடை","lemma":"கடை","gloss":"corner"}],"gloss":"rich corners (of the eyes)"},{"surface":"மழைக்கண்","parts":[{"text":"மழை","lemma":"மழை","gloss":"rain/coolness"},{"text":"கண்","lemma":"கண்","gloss":"eye"}],"gloss":"cool/rain-like eyes"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"டுளிதலை","parts":[{"text":"டுளிதலை","lemma":"துளிதலை","gloss":"dripping head / rain-dripping place"}],"gloss":"dripping head / rain-dripping place"},{"surface":"தலைஇய","parts":[{"text":"தலைஇய","lemma":"தலைஇய","gloss":"having received/encountered"}],"gloss":"having received/encountered"},{"surface":"தளிர்","parts":[{"text":"தளிர்","lemma":"தளிர்","gloss":"sprout/shoot"}],"gloss":"sprout/shoot"},{"surface":"அன்னோளே","parts":[{"text":"அன்னோள்","lemma":"அன்னோள்","gloss":"she who is like"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"emphasis"}],"gloss":"she who is like [that]"}]}],"literal":"If [one] takes the head-raft, [she] will take the head-raft / If [one] takes the tail-raft, [she] will take the tail-raft / Letting go of the raft's hand, if [one] flows with the water / There also she will come, it seems, [she of] excellent / rainy-season wild jasmine's water-dripping plump buds / resembling red sparks, rich-cornered cool eyes, / having received rain-drops, she who is like a tender shoot.","translation":"If one holds the front of the raft, she too holds the front of the raft. If one holds the back of the raft, she too holds the back of the raft. If one lets go of the raft and floats along with the current, she too will come there, it seems—she who is like a tender shoot that has received raindrops, with cool eyes of rich corners resembling the red-glowing, water-dripping plump buds of the wild jasmine in the excellent rainy season.","modern":"தலைப்புணையைப் பற்றிக்கொண்டால் அவளும் தலைப்புணையையே பற்றிக்கொள்வாள். கடைப்புணையைப் பற்றிக்கொண்டால் அவளும் கடைப்புணையையே பற்றிக்கொள்வாள். புணையை விட்டுவிட்டு நீரில் மிதந்து சென்றால், அவளும் அங்கேயும் வருவாள் போலும்! சிறந்த மாரிக்காலத்துப் பித்திகத்தின் நீர்த்துளிகள் வடியும் கொழுவிய மொட்டுகள் போன்ற, செவ்வரி படர்ந்த, குளிர்ச்சியான கண்களையும், மழைத்துளிகள் விழுந்த தளிரைப் போன்ற மென்மையையும் உடையவள் அவள்.","explanation":"The hero speaks to his friend or to himself, marveling at the heroine's absolute devotion and her willingness to follow him in any circumstance. He uses the metaphor of a raft in a rushing river: if he holds the front, she holds the front; if he holds the back, she holds the back; and if he lets go to float with the current, she will fearlessly float along with him. This imagery of the raft and the river beautifully illustrates how she has completely surrendered her will to his, sharing his fate entirely. Her physical beauty is described using rich nature imagery of the Kuriñci landscape, comparing her cool, red-streaked eyes to the water-dripping, plump buds of the wild jasmine blooming in the rainy season. Finally, comparing her to a tender shoot that has just received fresh raindrops highlights her delicate nature, youth, and deep emotional responsiveness to his love.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.7],[0.7,1.1],[1.1,1.42],[1.42,2.0],[2.0,2.83],[2.83,3.15],[3.15,3.8],[3.8,4.2],[4.5,5.1],[5.4,5.7],[5.7,6.0],[6.0,6.3],[6.3,6.8],[6.8,7.1],[7.1,7.46],[7.46,8.0],[8.0,9.0],[9.0,9.2],[9.2,9.6],[9.6,10.1],[10.1,11.03],[11.03,11.6],[11.6,12.4],[12.4,12.7],[12.9,13.8],[13.8,14.1],[14.1,14.6],[14.6,14.9]],"female":[[0.0,0.8],[0.8,1.2],[1.2,1.8],[1.8,2.0],[2.0,3.71],[3.71,3.85],[3.85,4.13],[4.13,4.7],[4.7,5.2],[5.2,5.87],[5.87,6.37],[6.37,7.03],[7.03,7.7],[7.7,8.2],[8.2,8.6],[8.6,9.0],[9.0,9.4],[9.4,10.2],[10.2,10.6],[10.6,11.45],[11.45,12.57],[12.57,12.9],[12.9,13.7],[13.7,14.0],[14.22,14.85],[14.85,15.35],[15.35,15.85],[15.85,16.1]]},"sync":[[["தலைப்புணை","first raft / head raft"]],[["கொளினே","if [one] takes/holds"]],[["தலைப்புணை","first raft / head raft"],["கொள்ளும்","will take/hold"]],[["கொள்ளும்","will take/hold"]],[["கடைப்புணை","last raft / end raft"]],[["கொளினே","if [one] takes/holds"]],[["கடைப்புணை","last raft / end raft"],["கொள்ளும்","will take/hold"]],[["கொள்ளும்","will take/hold"]],[["புணைகை","holding hand of the raft"]],[["விட்டு","letting go"],["புனலோடு","with the water/current"]],[["புனலோடு","with the water/current"]],[["புனலோடு","with the water/current"],["ஒழுகின்","if flowing/going along"]],[["ஆண்டும்","there also"]],[["வருகுவள்","she will come"]],[["போலும்","it seems"]],[["போலும்","it seems"],["மாண்ட","excellent / glorious"]],[["மாரி","rainy season"]],[["பித்திகத்து","of the wild jasmine"]],[["நீர்வார்","water-dripping"]],[["கொழுமுகை","plump bud"]],[["செவ்வெரி","red spark/glow"]],[["நுறழும்","resembling"]],[["கொழுங்கடை","rich corners (of the eyes)"]],[["மழைக்கண்","cool/rain-like eyes"]],[["டுளிதலை","dripping head / rain-dripping place"]],[["தலைஇய","having received/encountered"]],[["தளிர்","sprout/shoot"],["அன்னோளே","she who is like [that]"]],[["அன்னோளே","she who is like [that]"]]]}